msgstr ""
"在這個高階TCP網路協定中，也可以非常簡單地建立臨時TCP伺服器和客戶端。臨時 TCP "
"伺服器或用戶端可用於需要額外套接字或連接埠以避免與主伺服器或用戶端循環發生衝突的場景。例如檔案傳輸功能。建立臨時 TCP 伺服器和客戶端的 API"
" 定義為："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:766
#: b1e9ab095ed84ef8ae08333047df5b93
msgid ""
"``create_temporary_server`` returns ``(port, thread, stop_event)``: the "
"bound port (``palloc()`` picks one when ``port`` is None), the accept-"
"loop thread and an event whose ``set()`` stops the loop and frees the "
"port. It raises ``RuntimeError`` when ``port`` is None and no port can be"
" allocated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:771
#: d23ff87180c44746b62528903a34cdb5
